      "ReviewText": "X7 arrived the next day for me. Setup was straight forward. Setting the mowing zones with no go areas etc. was simple and quick. When it started mowing I anticipated their might be issues but the mower handled all the areas and trees that I did not mark fine. It has completed numerous complete mowings and required no assistance.  Everyone in the neighborhood slows down to watch it working. I would definitely recommend the Sunseeker to everyone.",
