        "Description": "The SUNSEEKER X7 is a premium AWD robot lawn mower designed for larger residential yards up to 0.75 acre, or approximately 32,000 sq. ft. Its 14 in. floating dual-blade cutting system covers more grass with each pass, while wire-free RTK, vSLAM and Vision AI navigation create systematic mowing paths across complex lawn layouts. AWD traction supports slopes up to 35° (about 70% grade) and improves control across uneven terrain. The cutting height adjusts through 9 positions from 0.8 to 4.0 in. A 20V 5Ah battery provides up to 180 minutes of runtime and recharges in about 1.5 hours. Use the SUNSEEKER app to auto-map the lawn, manage multiple zones, plan mowing paths, set schedules and adjust cutting height. Automatic recharging, rain, lift, tilt and collision sensors support autonomous operation, while quiet night mode, headlights, theft protection, smart-home integration and voice control add convenience. Backed by a 2-year manufacturer warranty.",
